1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一瓶辣酱，一年卖出54亿
One chili sauce — ¥5.4 billion a year.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
有华人的地方，就有它
Wherever Chinese live, it's there.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
老板娘50岁才摆摊起家
The founder started a stall at fifty.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
配方朴素：辣椒、豆豉、菜籽油
Just chili, black bean, rapeseed oil.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
一勺红油，能下一整碗饭
One spoon — a whole bowl of rice gone.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
拌面、炒饭、配馒头都行
Noodles, fried rice, plain buns — all of it.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
没砸广告，全靠一张嘴
No ad blitz — spread by word of mouth.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
被叫作"中国的可口可乐"
They call it "China's Coca-Cola".

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
一瓶辣酱，就这样走向世界
One jar quietly went global.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
你冰箱里，有没有这一瓶？
Is this jar in your fridge right now?

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
下集：川菜真正的魂
Next: the real soul of Sichuan food.
